   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">NWC303 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 13 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 11200 · Decision 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 03/04/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">NWC303 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>13 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 11200 · QĐ 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 03/04/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Configure devices by using security best practices</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Explain how Layer 2 switches forward data</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Implement VLANs and trunking in a switched network</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Explain how STP enables redundancy in a Layer 2 network</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Implement DHCPv4 to operate across multiple LANs</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Configure dynamic address allocation in IPv6 networks</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Explain how vulnerabilities compromise LAN security</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Implement switch security to mitigate LAN attacks.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Explain how WLANs enable network connectivity</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Implement a WLAN using a wireless router and WLC</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td><strong>CLO11</strong></td><td>Explain how routers use information in packets to make forwarding decisions</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>12</td><td><strong>CLO12</strong></td><td>Configure IPv4 and IPv6 static routes</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>13</td><td><strong>CLO13</strong></td><td>Troubleshoot static and default route configurations</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11200</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11200</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
