   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">NWC303 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbook: <strong>CCNA: Switching, Routing, and Wireless Essentials v7.0 (SRWE) Slides<br><br>available at <a href=\"https://www.netacad.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.netacad.com/</a></strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 11200 · Decision 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 03/04/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">NWC303 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>CCNA: Switching, Routing, and Wireless Essentials v7.0 (SRWE) Slides<br><br>available at <a href=\"https://www.netacad.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.netacad.com/</a></strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 11200 · QĐ 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 03/04/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CCNA: Switching, Routing, and Wireless Essentials v7.0 (SRWE) Slides<br><br>available at <a href=\"https://www.netacad.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.netacad.com/</a></strong></td><td>Cisco</td><td>Cisco</td><td>2021</td><td>7</td><td></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>E-Learning Content of CCNA - Switching, Routing, and Wireless Essentials Course: 12 modules<br><br>available at <a href=\"https://www.netacad.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.netacad.com/</a></strong></td><td>Cisco</td><td>Cisco</td><td>2021</td><td>7</td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Labs<br><br>available at <a href=\"https://www.netacad.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.netacad.com/</a></strong></td><td>Cisco</td><td>Cisco</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>Tools:<br><br>Baseline Equipment Bundle:<br><br>- 2 x ISR4221/K9 Routers<br><br>- 2 x WS-C2960+24TC-L Catalyst switches<br><br>- 1 wireless router (generic brand) with WPA2 support<br><br>- Ethernet patch cables<br><br>- PCs<br><br>- Internet connection for lab and student PCs<br><br>- Optional equipment for connecting to a WLAN<br><br>+ 1 printer or integrated printer/scanner/copier for the class to share<br><br>+ Smartphones and tablets are desirable for use with the labs<br><br>Student PC Software:<br><br>- Packet Tracer<br><br>- Open-source server software:<br><br>+ For various services and protocols, such as Telnet, SSH, HTTP, DHCP, FTP, TFTP, etc.<br><br>- Tera Term source SSH client software for lab PCs.<br><br>- Oracle VirtualBox, most recent version.<br><br>- Wireshark version 2.5 or higher.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>Tools:<br><br>Baseline Equipment Bundle:<br><br>- 2 x ISR4221/K9 Routers<br><br>- 2 x WS-C2960+24TC-L Catalyst switches<br><br>- 1 wireless router (generic brand) with WPA2 support<br><br>- Ethernet patch cables<br><br>- PCs<br><br>- Internet connection for lab and student PCs<br><br>- Optional equipment for connecting to a WLAN<br><br>+ 1 printer or integrated printer/scanner/copier for the class to share<br><br>+ Smartphones and tablets are desirable for use with the labs<br><br>Student PC Software:<br><br>- Packet Tracer<br><br>- Open-source server software:<br><br>+ For various services and protocols, such as Telnet, SSH, HTTP, DHCP, FTP, TFTP, etc.<br><br>- Tera Term source SSH client software for lab PCs.<br><br>- Oracle VirtualBox, most recent version.<br><br>- Wireshark version 2.5 or higher.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11200</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11200</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
